{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MXTuLgYDAADC3dfGc6FX82","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Perfect! I found the answer in the mailing list messages from February 20, 2026.\\\\n\\\\nBased on the email chain, on **2026-02-20**, Lucas Brutschy suggested a configuration name in his feedback to Arpit Goyal:\\\\n\\\\n**`processing.exception.handler.global.enabled`**\\\\n\\\\nLucas specifically suggested this as an alternative to the previously proposed name `default.processing.exception.handler.invoke.for.global.` The message from Lucas (in both files) states:\\\\n\\\\n> lb3: How about processing.exception.handler.global.enabled instead of default.processing.exception.handler.invoke.for.global.\\\\n\\\\nArpit Goyal then responded the same day (2026-02-20T10:21:56Z) confirming he had addressed all of Lucas's points and updated the KIP accordingly.\\\\n\\\\n**Sources:**\\\\n- `/store/kips/KIP-1270/2026-02-20-mail-59c5fd3092adaf090832eeba-08518722.md` (Lucas's suggestion at 09:41:00Z)\\\\n- `/store/kips/KIP-1270/2026-02-20-mail-d0ea5a94789da80c21eb21d1-6f0bfda8.md` (Arpit's confirmation at 10:21:56Z)\\\",\\\"error\\\":null,\\\"files\\\":[\\\"INDEX.md\\\",\\\"kips/KIP-1270/2026-02-20-mail-59c5fd3092adaf090832eeba-08518722.md\\\",\\\"kips/KIP-1270/2026-02-20-mail-d0ea5a94789da80c21eb21d1-6f0bfda8.md\\\"],\\\"seconds\\\":19.26,\\\"truncated\\\":false,\\\"turns\\\":2,\\\"usage\\\":{\\\"cache_read_tokens\\\":58146,\\\"cache_write_tokens\\\":35943,\\\"cost_usd\\\":0.0854926,\\\"input_tokens\\\":42,\\\"output_tokens\\\":1550}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"758be0c0-d9a7-422e-8893-9442847abd76","uuid":"e28e4597-8db3-4714-849b-25cf30a7e126","timestamp":"2026-09-27T18:13:41.894Z","tool_use_result":{"content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Perfect! I found the answer in the mailing list messages from February 20, 2026.\\\\n\\\\nBased on the email chain, on **2026-02-20**, Lucas Brutschy sugge